  "limitations": [
    "One macOS ARM64 workstation; loopback shaping does not qualify actual provider/TLS/HTTP2/signing performance.",
    "Five main repeats, three guard repeats. The approximately 1% GDAL difference is treated as practical parity.",
    "Working reservation is distinct from process RSS; the GDAL control retains its 32MiB cache outside the scheduler reservation.",
    "Extra encoded-buffer reservation reduced four-source active admission from4 to3 at16MiB, while completion improved in all three measured pairs. Other crossover workloads remain possible.",
    "Float32 NaN payloads/signed zero/masks, sparse AOI, reordered/repeated misses and transport failures are regression coverage, not the fresh UInt16 timing population."
  ],
